{
  "$description": "DTCG design tokens — STARTER SET. The taxonomy (surface/text/border/action/state/feedback, type scale, spacing, radius, shadows, motion, z) is the proven shape; the VALUES are placeholders from a reference project — replace them in Phase 1. Primitives are never used directly by components. Every colour pairing you document must be asserted in contrast.mjs.",
